# Exception: E049 BLCA outer_test handoff (2026-10-14) — completion.json + predictions.pkl only
# Pushes 20 task metadata so external reviewer can reproduce cindex from raw predictions.
# .pth checkpoints (1.6 GB total) stay local — described in MD only.
!results/e049_blca/outer_test/**/completion.json
!results/e049_blca/outer_test/**/outer_test_predictions.pkl

